        "text": "1st time I came here is because people recommended this place to visit.\nOnly take minutes from Thammel.\nPay 1000 rupees each was to expensive.\nOtherwise ok, we just try.\nin front of the ticket box, there's a man who explain places that cannot take pictures.\nAnd then he follow us to all the places explain.\nOverall, this places is not really good to take a pictures.\nBecause you cannot take picture in the temple. \nand here the surprise, that man who follow us was a guide (he didn't ask or introduce himself)\nand then asking 2000 rupees just to \"guide\" us.\nCome on, 4000 rupees to both of us, for just visiting this temple.\nNot worth it at all.",
